endpoint.request:
{ name: string required max:120 unique, description?: string|null max:2000,
        scopes: string[] required min:1 (ogni voce in config('external-api.scopes')),
        rate_limit_per_minute?: int|null between:1,1000, expires_at?: date|null after:now }

data_contract.common:
Header: Authorization: Bearer <chiave>, Accept: application/json.
Header di risposta su ogni chiamata autenticata: X-RateLimit-Limit, X-RateLimit-Remaining.
Errori comuni: 401 { success:false, message } chiave assente/invalida/revocata/scaduta o client disattivato;
403 { success:false, message } scope mancante; 429 { success:false, message } + Retry-After;
422 { success:false, message, errors:{campo:[...]} }; 404 { success:false, message }.
Paginazione list: query page (>=1), per_page (1..100, default 25);
response { success:true, data:[...], meta:{ current_page, per_page, total, last_page } }.
